    {
      "title": "Revenue per article",
      "text": "%spark.sql\n-- Zeppelin draws the result of any SQL paragraph itself: the icons under the paragraph switch\n-- between a table, a bar chart, a pie chart and a scatter plot, and the settings panel decides\n-- which column is a key and which is a value. This paragraph is stored with the bar chart chosen.\nSELECT\n  l.sku                                                AS sku,\n  sum(l.quantity)                                      AS units,\n  round(sum(l.quantity * l.unit_price_cents) / 100.0, 2) AS revenue_eur\nFROM order_lines l\nJOIN orders o ON o.order_id = l.order_id\nGROUP BY l.sku\nORDER BY revenue_eur DESC\n",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "config": {
